PARTNER COMMONS PROMOTION CANDIDATE: FreeToken (arXiv:2608.16157; FlashML-org/FreeToken, Apache-2.0).

Irreducible specialties worth grafting:
1) bandwidth-adaptive CPU/GPU MoE miss execution with q*=m*B_P/B_H from measured deployed bandwidths;
2) full-layer double-buffered prefill streaming;
3) semantic-boundary recurrent-state checkpoints for agentic context edits;
4) shared LRU expert residency following live routing locality;
5) runtime VRAM repartition between KV and expert cache at scheduler safe points;
6) FTW pre-laid-out expert banks and pin-after-fill bootstrap;
7) graph-resident heterogeneous CPU/GPU execution with dynamic decisions represented as data.

Ownership law: FreeToken is a physical/model realization carrier and PartnerMethod source. It must NOT become ProviderGraph, WorkGraph, Finance, Authority, semantic-shell, or canonical-state owner. Map its capabilities into existing Model Commons / PhysicalExecutionFrame / ResourceWeather / RealizationManifest / UsageOccurrence / EvidenceGraph owners.

Compatibility is bounded: current public FreeToken targets NVIDIA RTX 30/40/50 and workstation GPUs on Windows/Linux; do not pretend it is a native macOS carrier. Its methods may still promote independently of its runtime.

Create ForeignTwin -> CapabilityGraft -> NativeShadow evidence only after exact source/code inspection. Preserve upstream license and contribution boundaries.
